SimpleLoginMessages was created to replace the join and quit messaging
functionality previously provided by PLM (Personal Login Message) by
FantasticSkyThrow on the maintainer's server. PLM is no longer supported and
no longer available for newer Minecraft server releases.

Paper API and LuckPerms API are provided dependencies and are not bundled in
the plugin JAR. They retain their own licenses.
